{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佐賀県出身 19歳 佐藤愛桜です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすっかり秋になりましたね🍁🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この季節はよく〇〇の秋と言いますが、皆さんはどんな秋をお過ごしですか??"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は大好きなお散歩の秋を過ごしております☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "澄んだ空に風が少し冷たくて心地いい空気が大好きです~お散歩をすると季節を感じる事ができるのでいいんですよね( *´꒳`*)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はるさんとお散歩した時の写真です🌱‬‪"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob1f6SJy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobY54eRU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobGJWLaS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob9vi28K.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob9W0uxg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobwfQiun.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobP8XgRT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobXIm2ii.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にたーくさん歩きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと気になっていたところに行ってみたり、偶然の出会いを楽しみながら気の向くままに歩いてみたり、聖地巡礼みたいなことをしてみたり！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても楽しかったです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はるさんは沢山下調べをしてくれていて、色んな知識を私に教えてくれてすごく嬉しかったです( *´꒳`*)ありがとう~🥹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また行こうね♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんが知ってる素敵な場所やおすすめの散歩コースがあったら是非教えて下さい♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日、25時55分〜サクラミーツが放送されます🌸\nいつか挑戦してみたいなと思っていた十番勝負企画もあります~！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "瞳月さんも出演されますので、是非お楽しみに🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急に寒くなってきたので体調には気を付けて下さいね( ; ; )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobunPVng.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "NEOポーズしてみました^^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで見て頂きありがとうございました🌱"}], "source": "official"}